-- Alex 2026-10-31, the night before launch. The 13 puppies added to the live Wix store between 2026-10-22
-- and 2026-10-27, read 2026-10-31T03:32:28Z. Each breeder is matched by the phone number on the listing (Paw Print Acres
-- 574-900-2968, Gold Paw Canine 717-640-3490, Double YY Puppies 217-472-2230). The four Mini Dachshunds give only
-- Puppy Connection's own number, so they go under Unassigned Wix listings until Amber names their breeder.
-- Description is the breeder's paragraph about the puppy, as on the earlier imports. Photos were fetched whole from
-- Wix, stripped of metadata, converted to sRGB, kept to 2000 px and uploaded to R2 at their r2_key before this runs.
-- The lead photo's focus point sits on the puppy's face; the others take the middle. Every row is inserted only
-- when missing, so a second run changes nothing. Back up D1 first and confirm the export printed "Downloaded".
UPDATE site_state SET dirty = 1, dirty_since = COALESCE(dirty_since, '2026-10-31T03:32:28Z'), generation = generation + 1
  WHERE id = 1 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM puppies WHERE id = 'seed-p-0304');
